# --- Antora ---
docs/build/
public/
# …but the unified search index is generated SOURCE (Astro serves public/ at the
# site root), committed + drift-gated by check:search-index — re-include it.
!tutorials/public/
!tutorials/public/search-index.json
# …but the favicon IS a build-copy of shared/flatbars-favicon.svg (regenerated by
# the `favicon` prebuild hook, like spec/public/) — keep it untracked.
tutorials/public/favicon.svg

# VS Code extension packaging artifacts
*.vsix

